orthant 1 language

- # `↯/s.100.8` — `Url.Error`
+ # `↯/s.100.8` — `Url.Error`

- Raised when a value cannot be parsed as a valid URL.
+ Lançado quando um valor não pode ser analisado como uma URL válida.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- Urticose validates URL syntax against the components it expects: a
- scheme, optional authority (with hostname and port), path, query and
- fragment. Each variant pinpoints where parsing failed. The message
- includes the bad input and the offset of the failure: `the URL $text
- is not valid: $reason at $offset`.
+ O Urticose valida a sintaxe de URLs contra os componentes que espera: um esquema, uma autoridade
+ opcional (com hostname e porta), caminho, consulta e fragmento. Cada variante aponta onde a
+ análise falhou. A mensagem inclui a entrada inválida e o offset da falha:
+ `the URL $text is not valid: $reason at $offset`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Variantes

- ### `↯/s.100.8.1` — `Expected`
+ ### `↯/s.100.8.1` — `Expected`

- A specific token was expected at the offset, but a different one
- appeared. The expectation is one of `Colon`, `More`, `LowerCaseLetter`,
- `PortRange`, or `Number`.
+ Um token específico era esperado no offset, mas apareceu outro. A expectativa é uma de `Colon`,
+ `More`, `LowerCaseLetter`, `PortRange` ou `Number`.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.100.8.1] the URL https://example is not valid: a colon was expected at 14`
+ **Exemplo.** `[↯/s.100.8.1] the URL https://example is not valid: a colon was expected at 14`

- **Resolution.** Adjust the URL to provide the expected token at the
- indicated offset.
+ **Resolução.** Ajuste a URL para fornecer o token esperado no offset indicado.

- ### `↯/s.100.8.2` — `BadHostname`
+ ### `↯/s.100.8.2` — `BadHostname`

- The hostname component of the URL is not a valid DNS hostname.
+ O componente hostname da URL não é um hostname DNS válido.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.100.8.2] the URL http://exa_mple/ is not valid: exa_mple was not valid because the character _ is not allowed in a hostname at 7`
+ **Exemplo.** `[↯/s.100.8.2] the URL http://exa_mple/ is not valid: exa_mple was not valid because the character _ is not allowed in a hostname at 7`

- **Resolution.** Replace the hostname with a syntactically valid one;
- see `↯/s.100.10` for hostname rules.
+ **Resolução.** Substitua o hostname por um sintaticamente válido; veja `↯/s.100.10` para as
+ regras de hostnames.

- ### `↯/s.100.8.3` — `BadIpv6`
+ ### `↯/s.100.8.3` — `BadIpv6`

- The bracketed IPv6 literal in the host component is not valid.
+ O literal IPv6 entre colchetes no componente de host não é válido.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.100.8.3] the URL http://[::1::]/ is not valid: the IPv6 address is not valid because :: appears more than once at 7`
+ **Exemplo.** `[↯/s.100.8.3] the URL http://[::1::]/ is not valid: the IPv6 address is not valid because :: appears more than once at 7`

- **Resolution.** Provide a valid IPv6 literal; see `↯/s.100.2` for
- IPv6 rules.
+ **Resolução.** Forneça um literal IPv6 válido; veja `↯/s.100.2` para as regras de IPv6.

